{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Diona Pet in Shimagami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u203bThis is a DLC for the game &quot;Shimagami&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You cannot play skins it if you only purchase the DLC.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Why this is Expensive ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the in-game version of my cat, Diona. When Diona was born, she and her three siblings were thrown into a trash bin inside a box. We rescued all four kittens\u2014two boys and two girls\u2014and Diona became my cat. Her brother, Appa, was adopted by my sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All proceeds from this DLC will go toward supporting the care of Diona and her siblings. Whether you buy this DLC or not, I will take great care of them no matter what. But as a content creator, the budget I can allocate for this is, as you might imagine, quite limited. So I chose this path to let my followers support both Diona and my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, Diona will follow you, attack enemies alongside you, and heal you when you\u2019re injured. There's also a free cat pet in the game that does similar things\u2014but Diona... I just couldn\u2019t leave her out of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There images of Diona</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698480/extras/photo_2025-04-16_20-24-22.jpg?t=1746092257\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With her brother Appa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698480/extras/photo_2025-04-16_20-14-00.jpg?t=1746092257\" /><i